# {{project_name}}

{{project_name}} is a FastAPI full-stack project, scaffolded by [dev-ready](https://github.com/MoofonLi/dev-ready) on top of [fastapi/full-stack-fastapi-template](https://github.com/fastapi/full-stack-fastapi-template): a FastAPI + SQLModel + PostgreSQL backend and a React + TypeScript + Vite frontend, wired together with Docker Compose.

## Stack

- **Backend**: FastAPI, SQLModel, PostgreSQL, Pydantic, Alembic - `backend/`
- **Frontend**: React, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, TanStack Query, TanStack Router, TanStack Table, `react-hook-form` with `zod` - `frontend/`
- **Infra**: Docker Compose, Traefik reverse proxy - `compose.yml`

## Commands

- `docker compose up -d` - start the full stack (backend, frontend, database, proxy)
- `docker compose watch` - start with live reload for local development
- `docker compose down` - stop the stack
- Backend serve: `cd backend && uv run fastapi dev app/main.py`
- Backend tests: run `docker compose up -d db mailcatcher`, then run `bash scripts/prestart.sh` and `bash scripts/tests-start.sh` from `backend/` (pytest with coverage; live services required)
- Backend checks: `cd backend && bash scripts/lint.sh` (mypy strict, ty, ruff check, ruff format); format: `cd backend && bash scripts/format.sh`; coverage floor: 90%
- Frontend install: use Bun: `bun install` from the repository root; serve: `cd frontend && bun run dev`
- Frontend tests: `cd frontend && bunx playwright test` (Playwright)
- Frontend checks: `cd frontend && bunx biome check ./`; type-check: `cd frontend && bunx tsc -p tsconfig.build.json`; format: `cd frontend && bunx biome format --write ./`

## Repo layout

- `backend/` - FastAPI application, SQLModel models, Alembic migrations
- `frontend/` - React application
- `compose.yml` - local development orchestration (`compose.override.yml` adds the local-dev overrides)

